## Main Tables

| Table                   | Description                         |
| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| `customers`             | Restaurant customers                |
| `employees`             | Restaurant employees                |
| `restaurant_tables`     | Restaurant tables                   |
| `menu_categories`       | Menu categories                     |
| `menu_items`            | Menu items                          |
| `orders`                | Customer orders                     |
| `order_items`           | Items included in orders            |
| `reservations`          | Table reservations                  |
| `payments`              | Order payments                      |
| `suppliers`             | Ingredient suppliers                |
| `ingredients`           | Restaurant ingredients and stock    |
| `menu_item_ingredients` | Ingredients required for menu items |

## Views

* `menu_catalog`
* `order_details`
* `order_totals`
* `low_stock_ingredients`
